{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your special living pumpkin and help her evolve from level 1 to 7 in this sensual clicker game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: <strong>keep her fed and clean</strong>, or it\u2019s game over. Use your mouse to interact with everything \u2014 feed, wash, grow crops, complete quests, and unlock adult scenes and outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow and sell pumpkins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant and water regular pumpkins to earn coins. The better your farming, the faster you\u2019ll be able to afford candies and cute clothes for your special pumpkin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep her alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed and wash her through simple minigames \u2014 miss the timing, and you may lose hearts and get no reward. If hunger or hygiene drops to zero when the day changes, your pumpkin dies and the game resets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock spicy scenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level unlocks a new adult scene, starting at level 1 and reaching up to 7. These scenes feature higher-quality sprites and some even reflect the outfits your pumpkin is wearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time passes with every action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a 4-phase day cycle (morning, noon, afternoon, night). Every time you visit a location (like shop, feed, wash, or love level), time progresses. At the end of each day, your pumpkin loses a bit of hygiene and hunger \u2014 so plan carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect clothes (optional but fun!)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clothes can be used both in the lobby and in some of the adult scenes. You\u2019ll need to complete quests and manage your coins wisely to collect them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete 14 quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests help you earn more money and progress through the game. Most give coins, and finishing all of them unlocks something special for dedicated players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Easy Seller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910180/f1b6be95d06ba9349ffab4baabf1b9e99799d514.jpg"},{"name":"Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910180/b8b7770c6c155c99ff739971f938e3e7de08e247.jpg"},{"name":"Candy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910180/22e3838b02b906bfbd43d6eb7f0d7f8134090e50.jpg"},{"name":"No Dirt!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910180/da22367f873da5205b5b4b2054aab23001536790.jpg"},{"name":"Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910180/a060556fd8e9211e2002c1f30f32d559c6a35276.jpg"},{"name":"Good Seller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910180/616178cbe4fd55759577eb92b70180e0f99818bd.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Rich!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910180/46b73aac939e72bdd574a6bd62102fea84760ed5.jpg"},{"name":"Level Max","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910180/562880c2aaa5df5200ea06bfc0db94eb03b24607.jpg"},{"name":"Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910180/838622f503aa9984795d70a80175a99b2bad44a7.jpg"},{"name":"Gold 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910180/3cd8db20dec1474ed563fdf37ab20e48b46d066b.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910180?t=1758215721","background_raw":"https://